      "raw": "## Current Contract\n",
      "level": 2,
      "title": "Current Contract"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000010",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 19,
      "end_line": 25,
      "raw": "- `UnusedNoteSensorSupport` validates the hub path but no longer scans note packages while the note package model is\n  deleted.\n- `WeeklyUnusedNote` and `MonthlyUnusedNote` currently return empty note result lists.\n- Both note sensors keep their public properties so callers do not need a view contract change during the package-model\n  removal.\n- `UnusedResourcesSensor` scans hub-local `.wsresource` packages and returns package inventory as unused candidates.\n- The sensor no longer reads note body source or editor-side DOM projections.\n",
      "items": [
